\title{Parameterised theories}
\import{prelude}

\p{Coln also provides the facility for functions at the \em{theory} level, which enables code reuse between database schemas. As a simple example:}

\pre{%
\kw{theory} ProcessOn (Stage : Set) := \kw{sig}
  next : Stage -> Stage
\kw{end}
}

\pre{%
\kw{theory} Factory := \kw{sig}
  Step : Set
  chocolate-recipe : ProcessOn Step
  Room : Set
  boat-ride : ProcessOn Room
\kw{end}
}

